  "arena.scenarios.def_int_02.opt_1": "1. Immediately invalidate/revoke the compromised key in the Telebirr merchant portal. 2. Generate a new key and update server env. 3. Audit recent API logs for unauthorized transactions. 4. Rewrite Git history with git-filter-repo.",
  "arena.scenarios.def_int_02.opt_2": "Turn off your computer and wait until tomorrow morning.",
