  "journey.evidence.urgency": "Warning Sign: An extreme countdown (\"Only 2 hours remaining!\") creates panic so victims react impulsively before they can verify.",
  "journey.evidence.urgency_title": "Artificial Urgency Pressure",
  "journey.evidence.url": "Warning Sign: The simulated domain uses unencrypted HTTP and an unverified, non-institutional address. Note: generic domains are not always malicious, but when combined with fee demands, they warrant extreme caution.",
