  "learn.obj.password": "Learning Objectives:\n- Understand why passphrase length surpasses complexity in mathematical entropy.\n- Eliminate cross-account credential reuse and credential stuffing vulnerabilities.\n- Deploy Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) using hardware-tied or app-based TOTP.\n- Formulate resilient, memorable passphrases without writing secrets on unencrypted media.",
  "learn.obj.phishing": "Learning Objectives:\n- Dissect deceptive message structures and psychological manipulation triggers.\n- Understand domain spoofing, homographs, and look-alike URL patterns.\n- Apply the Zero-Trust link verification workflow before tapping or entering credentials.\n- Safely report and contain credential harvesting attempts targeting Ethiopian services.",
  "learn.obj.privacy": "Learning Objectives:\n- Audit your personal digital footprint and identify exposed Personally Identifiable Information (PII).\n- Recognize social engineering pretexting and targeted manipulation tactics.\n- Configure strict privacy controls on mobile applications and social media platforms.\n- Verify urgent requests out-of-band before sharing sensitive personal data or funds.",
  "learn.obj.response": "Learning Objectives:\n- Execute the 15-minute emergency containment checklist during an active cyber compromise.\n- Preserve legally admissible digital evidence without altering timestamps or file hashes.\n- Understand the Chain of Custody requirements for cybersecurity incident reporting.\n- Draft an actionable, privacy-safe incident report using ABBAY CYBERGUARD M3.",
  "learn.obj.website": "Learning Objectives:\n- Understand Transport Layer Security (TLS/HTTPS) and differentiate encryption from trust.\n- Evaluate defensive HTTP security headers (CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options).\n- Prevent Cross-Site Scripting (XSS), Clickjacking, and credential leakage.\n- Configure hardened, production-ready web servers using Nginx and Apache.",
